meta, headings, alt text)<\/li><li>Google Maps embed on Contact<\/li><li>POPIA-compliant<\/li><li>Free SSL certificate<\/li><li>1 round of revisions<\/li><li>14-day turnaround<\/li><li>30 days post-launch support<\/li><\/ul><div class=\"pc-best\"><strong>Best for:<\/strong> Sole traders and startups needing a credible online presence fast.<\/div><a class=\"pc-cta\" href=\"\/contact?service=web-design&amp;tier=starter\">Get a Quote<\/a><\/article><article class=\"pc pc-feat\"><span class=\"pc-ribbon\">Most Popular<\/span><div class=\"pc-name\">Business<\/div><div class=\"pc-price\">R8,500<\/div><div class=\"pc-tag\">A complete service-business website built to convert visitors into enquiries.<\/div><ul class=\"pc-list\"><li>Up to 6 pages<\/li><li>Custom design within the MPS framework<\/li><li>Mobile + tablet optimised<\/li><li>Full on-page SEO (Rank Math, LocalBusiness schema)<\/li><li>Maps embed + structured contact data<\/li><li>Multiple form types (quote, contact, callback)<\/li><li>WhatsApp Business integration<\/li><li>Google Analytics 4 + Search Console<\/li><li>Image optimisation (WebP, lazy-load)<\/li><li>POPIA-compliant<\/li><li>2 rounds of revisions<\/li><li>21-day turnaround<\/li><li>60 days post-launch support<\/li><\/ul><div class=\"pc-best\"><strong>Best for:<\/strong> Established service businesses ready to earn enquiries consistently.<\/div><a class=\"pc-cta\" href=\"\/contact?service=web-design&amp;tier=business\">Get a Quote<\/a><\/article><article class=\"pc\"><span class=\"pc-badge\">Best Value<\/span><div class=\"pc-name\">Growth<\/div><div class=\"pc-price\">R12,000<\/div><div class=\"pc-tag\">Engineered for businesses that need a real lead-generation system, not just a website.<\/div><div class=\"pc-plus\">Everything in Business, plus:<\/div><ul class=\"pc-list\"><li>Up to 10 pages<\/li><li>Service-specific landing pages (3 included)<\/li><li>Advanced SEO (technical audit, performance, FAQ schema)<\/li><li>Conversion-focused copywriting guidance<\/li><li>Custom hero design \/ illustrations<\/li><li>Blog setup with 3 categories<\/li><li>Email integration (HubSpot, Mailchimp or Zoho)<\/li><li>WhatsApp chatbot integration (Tidio or similar)<\/li><li>PageSpeed optimisation (90+ mobile target)<\/li><li>3 rounds of revisions<\/li><li>30-day turnaround<\/li><li>90 days post-launch support<\/li><\/ul><div class=\"pc-best\"><strong>Best for:<\/strong> Growth-focused businesses ready to run paid ads, SEO or content alongside the site.<\/div><a class=\"pc-cta\" href=\"\/contact?service=web-design&amp;tier=growth\">Get a Quote<\/a><\/article><article class=\"pc\"><div class=\"pc-name\">Custom \/ E-Commerce<\/div><div class=\"pc-price\"><span class=\"pc-from\">From<\/span> R20,000<\/div><div class=\"pc-tag\">Full custom builds, e-commerce stores, booking platforms and bespoke integrations.<\/div><ul class=\"pc-list\"><li>Fully bespoke design (no template constraints)<\/li><li>Unlimited pages within agreed scope<\/li><li>E-commerce (WooCommerce or Shopify) + payments<\/li><li>Booking systems (Bookly, Amelia or custom)<\/li><li>Member areas \/ login portals<\/li><li>Custom integrations (CRM, ERP, accounting)<\/li><li>Advanced SEO + content strategy<\/li><li>Multi-language support if needed<\/li><li>Performance + security hardening<\/li><li>Quarterly strategy reviews for 6 months<\/li><li>Custom training for your team<\/li><li>6 months post-launch support<\/li><\/ul><div class=\"pc-note\">Quoted per project based on scope. Average final price R20,000 to R45,000.<\/div><div class=\"pc-best\"><strong>Best for:<\/strong> E-commerce, multi-location businesses, and custom functionality.<\/div><a class=\"pc-cta\" href=\"\/contact?service=web-design&amp;tier=custom\">Get a Quote<\/a><\/article><\/div><\/div><style>.mps-price-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:start;}.mps-price .pc{position:relative;background:var(--e-global-color-light);border:1px solid #E8EAF0;border-radius:18px;padding